9. Contamination Control

9.1 Threat Model

LLMs have memorized public rocket engine data, including Raptor chamber pressure and $I_{sp}$ values. This creates a confound: an LLM-seeded search may appear superior due to memorized specifications.

9.2 Co-Primary Evidence: Synthetic Design Space

V0.3 treated the synthetic design space as "secondary." V0.4 promotes it to co-primary evidence. The synthetic design space uses:

· Non-real fluids with arbitrary critical properties;
· Synthetic pump/turbine maps generated from arbitrary loss correlations;
· Held-out synthetic engine architectures not present in any public corpus.

