For smooth responses, the output  Y = f(\xi_1, \ldots, \xi_d)  is approximated by:

Y \approx \sum_{|\alpha| \leq p} c_\alpha \Psi_\alpha(\boldsymbol{\xi})

where  \Psi_\alpha  are multivariate orthogonal polynomials and  c_\alpha  are coefficients determined by Galerkin projection or stochastic collocation.

